{"id":"kogda","lemma":"когда","pos":"conj","rank":35,"glosses":["when"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/6b/Ru-%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%B4%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%B4%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ты когда обратно?","en":"When will you be back?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/727745","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"back, backwards"}]},{"text":"Где и когда мы встретимся?","en":"When and where shall we meet?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/681292","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"and"},null,{"g":"we"},{"g":"to meet","l":"встретиться"}]},{"text":"Когда ты это решил?","en":"When did you decide this?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1283384","words":[null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to solve, to settle","l":"решить"}]},{"text":"Я не уверен, когда он придёт.","en":"I'm not sure when he'll come.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/72598","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},null,null,{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to come , to arrive","l":"прийти"}]},{"text":"Скажи когда.","en":"Say when.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1264839","words":[{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"},null]}]}